  "abstract": "Red Hat Identity Management (IdM) is a centralized authentication, identity management, and authorization solution for both traditional and cloud-based enterprise environments.\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):\n\n* Pagure #9465: IPA stops working if HTTP/... service principal was created before FreeIPA 4.4.0 and never modified [rhel-8.9.0.z] (JIRA:RHEL-24356)\n\n* Pagure #9517: sidgen plugin does not ignore staged users [rhel-8.9.0.z] (JIRA:RHEL-24380)\n\n* Memory leak in IdM's KDC [rhel-8.9.0.z] (JIRA:RHEL-24384) \n\n* Pagure #9519: session cookie can't be read [rhel-8.9.0.z] (JIRA:RHEL-24387)\n\n* Enable Bronze-Bit check only if SIDs are set [rhel-8.9.0.z] (JIRA:RHEL-24390) \n\n* Pagure #9504: Gating-DL1 test failure in test_integration/test_dns_locations.py::TestDNSLocations::()::test_ipa_ca_records [rhel-8.9.0.z] (JIRA:RHEL-24395)\n\n* Pagure #9514: Make sure a default NetBIOS name is set if not passed in by ADTrust instance constructor [rhel-8.9.0.z] (JIRA:RHEL-24399)\n\n* tier-1-upstream-dns-locations failed on RHEL8.8 gating [rhel-8.9.0.z] (JIRA:RHEL-25711)\n\n* Pagure #9535: ipa-kdb: Cannot determine if PAC generator is available [rhel-8.9.0.z] (JIRA:RHEL-25745)",
